{"ID":"20240504170622-lbs0wyg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170622-lbs0wyg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170622-lbs0wyg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624100245-e01eo74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611124958-c0hjuk7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624103738-sah3xyd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"155长石","type":"doc","updated":"20240813140603"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240624100245-e01eo74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624100245-e01eo74","updated":"20240813140417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 441px;","style":"width: 431px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"长石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/长石-20240813140415-ix89pjc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 431px;\" parent-style=\"width: 441px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813140455-nqqk3t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813140455-nqqk3t3","updated":"20240813140455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"长石 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/长石 1-20240813140455-7daxf24.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813140554-svpu5ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813140554-svpu5ih","updated":"20240813140554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 694px;","style":"width: 684px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"长石 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/长石 2-20240813140554-p3ed10w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 684px;\" parent-style=\"width: 694px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624103614-4or24mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624103614-4or24mk","updated":"20240813140603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 696px;","style":"width: 686px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"长石矿"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/长石矿-20240624103614-1aj3lkq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 686px;\" parent-style=\"width: 696px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240624103402-dqa1ify","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624103402-dqa1ify","updated":"20240624103402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：石膏分两种，软石膏跟硬石膏；（软石膏：软石膏作层如压扁米豆糕形，就像年糕一样一层一层的，每层厚数寸，有红白二色，红色不可服，白色洁净细纹，短密如束针，正如凝成白蜡状，松软易烂，烧之即白烂如粉），这是真正的正品石膏；（软石膏）其中明洁色带微青，而文长细如白丝者，名理石也。与软石膏乃一物二种，碎之形色如一，不可辨矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240624103402-vguq6mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624103402-vguq6mk","updated":"20240624103402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"硬石膏里面又分两种，一种是方解石一种是长石；硬石膏作块而生，直里气棱，如马牙齿尖坚白则段段横解，光亮如云母白石英，在墙壁烧之易散，仍硬不作粉（不容易碎），其似硬石膏成块，击之块块方解，墙壁有光明者，名方解石。方解石烧之，诧散亦不烂，与硬石膏乃一类二种。（方解石就是现在所谓的南寒水石，上文的红石膏常用作北寒水石，但跟神农本草经记载的寒水石不是一个东西）"}]},{"ID":"20240624103402-v4zr487","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624103402-v4zr487","updated":"20240624103402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长石即俗呼硬石膏者，状如软石膏而块不扁，性坚硬洁白，有粗理。起齿棱击之片片横碎，光莹如云母白石英。亦有墙壁，似方解石（跟方解石很相似），但不作方块尔，烧之亦不粉烂而易散，方解石烧之亦然，诧声为异尔（两者烧的时候声音不太一样）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125027-mng966b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125027-mng966b"}},{"ID":"20240611125029-mtxgcyy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125029-mtxgcyy","updated":"20240611125034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长石《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125029-4tlwbwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125029-4tlwbwk","updated":"20240611125029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125029-fxiy6qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125029-fxiy6qj","updated":"20240611125029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主身热，四肢寒厥，利小便，通血脉，明目，去翳，眇，下三虫，杀蛊毒。久服不饥。一名方石。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125029-ap4yrq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125029-ap4yrq6","updated":"20240611125029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：长石一名方石，一名直石，生长子山谷，如马齿，润泽玉色长鲜，服之不饥（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125029-g7j7pu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125029-g7j7pu9","updated":"20240611125029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名土石，一名直石，理如马齿，方面润泽，玉色，生长子山，及太山临溜采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125045-wnpkz08","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125045-wnpkz08"}},{"ID":"20240611125046-j005jpa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125046-j005jpa","updated":"20240611125050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长石《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125046-qm10ey6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125046-qm10ey6","updated":"20240611125046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、苦，寒，无毒。主治身热，胃中结气，四肢寒厥，利小便，通血脉。明目，去翳眇，去三虫，杀蛊毒。止消渴，下气，除胁肋肺间邪气。久服不饥。一名方石，一名土石，一名直石。理如马齿，方而润泽，玉色。生长子山谷及太山、临淄，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125046-hdm3rtl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125046-hdm3rtl","updated":"20240611125046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长子县属上党郡，临淄县属青州。世方及《仙经》并无用此者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124844-v7aa3tg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124844-v7aa3tg"}},{"ID":"20240611125021-ya83dha","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-ya83dha","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长石《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125021-0xkjtk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-0xkjtk2","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、苦，寒，无毒。主身热，胃中结气，四肢寒厥，利小便，通血脉，明目，去翳眇，去三虫，杀蛊毒。止消渴，下气，除胁肋肺间邪气。久服不饥。一名方石，一名土石，一名直石，理如马齿，方而润泽，玉色。生长子山谷及太山、临淄，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125021-cyz9ayd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-cyz9ayd","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长子县属上党郡，临淄县属青州。俗方及《仙经》并无用此者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125021-l2zosbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-l2zosbd","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此石状同石膏而浓大，纵理而长，文似马齿，今均州辽 山有之，土人以为理石者，是长石也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125021-lph4lw5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-lph4lw5","updated":"20240611125021"}},{"ID":"20240611125021-b7k0tgf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-b7k0tgf","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长石《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125021-hwtc4lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-hwtc4lp","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛苦，寒，无毒。主身热，胃中结气，四肢寒厥，利小便，通血脉，明目，去翳眇，下三虫，杀蛊毒，止消渴，下气除胁肋肺间邪气。久服不饥。一名方石，一名土石，一名置石。理如马齿，方面润泽玉色。生长子山谷及太山临淄，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125021-lr676fi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-lr676fi","updated":"20240611125021"}},{"ID":"20240611125021-upf65qw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-upf65qw","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长石《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125021-pr70wu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125021-pr70wu2","updated":"20240611125021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长石，生长子山谷及泰山、临淄，今惟路州有之。纹如马齿，方而润泽玉色。此石颇似石膏，但浓大，纵理而长为别耳。采无时。谨按《本经》理石、长石二物二条，其味与功效亦别。又云∶理石如石膏顺理而细。陶隐居云∶理石亦呼为长理石。苏恭云∶理石皮黄赤，肉白，作斜理，不似石膏，市人刮去皮以代寒水石，并当 石。今灵宝丹用长、理石为一物。医家相承用者，乃似石膏，与今潞州所出长石无异，而诸郡无复出理石，医方亦不见单用，往往呼长石为长理石。又市中所货寒水石，亦有带黄赤皮者，不知果是理石否？"}]},{"ID":"20240611124845-js84vio","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124845-js84vio"}},{"ID":"20240611124846-xyfrnm4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-xyfrnm4","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：长石"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-negqiqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-negqiqo","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-xraxy61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-xraxy61","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Chánɡ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-9benqq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-9benqq5","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-p6sodnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-p6sodnr","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 方石（《本经》），直石（《吴普本草》），土石（《别录》），硬石膏（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-y3qnib7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-y3qnib7","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-m1dz2jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-m1dz2jx","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-ddzqmlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-ddzqmlu","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-0onxtpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-0onxtpn","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 硫酸盐类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"硬石膏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"矿石"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-3sg0ds7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-3sg0ds7","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-va1s0gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-va1s0gx","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 斜方晶系。晶形板状或短柱状，惟不多见，一般成致密粒状、大理石状集合体。颜色白灰、淡蓝、淡红及黑色等。条痕白色。玻璃或脂肪光泽。透明或微透明。断口参差状。硬度3～3.5。比重2.95。性脆。产于沉积岩层、热液矿脉、火成熔岩及接触交代矿床中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-us2ahr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-us2ahr1","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-ewaalg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-ewaalg4","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"味辛，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-n93wbib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-n93wbib","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"苦，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-lvyt4t7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-lvyt4t7","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-buk700s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-buk700s","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"主身热，四肢寒厥，利小便，通血脉，明目去翳眇。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-9wccinb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-9wccinb","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主胃中结气，止消渴，下气，除胁肋肺间邪气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-g12u880","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-g12u880","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-hqenaih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-hqenaih","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.5～3两。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-wb2xd3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-wb2xd3t","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-nt4wzf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-nt4wzf8","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-x9wg9di","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-x9wg9di","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：长石"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-za75uo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-za75uo9","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-fnuy6gb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-fnuy6gb","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Chánɡ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-aew60q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-aew60q1","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-b7urhyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-b7urhyi","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 方石、直石、土石、硬石膏"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-ldghejt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-ldghejt","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-jzn2num","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-jzn2num","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Anhydrite"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-hpkt4nw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-hpkt4nw","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-ms6f0pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-ms6f0pg","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-23x03x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-23x03x6","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《别录》：长石，理如马齿，方而润泽玉色。生长于山谷，及太山临淄。采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-qvtzmr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-qvtzmr9","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：长石即俗呼硬石膏者，状似软石膏而块不扁，性坚硬洁白，有粗理起齿棱，击之则片片横碎，光莹如云母、白石英，亦有墙壁，似方解石，但不作方块尔。烧之亦不粉烂而易散，方解烧之亦然，但TUO声为异尔。昔人以此为石膏，又以为方解，今人以此为寒水石，皆误矣。但与方解乃一类二种，故亦名方石，"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-xfudk06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-xfudk06","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-xbs9hwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-xbs9hwt","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：硫酸盐类矿物硬石膏的矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-9phi4dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-9phi4dv","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Anhydrite"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-8ixf6nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-8ixf6nh","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-agkzq3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-agkzq3e","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：产于沉积岩层、热液矿脉、火成熔岩及接触交代矿床中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-tdun2na","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-tdun2na","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：产于山西、甘肃、青海、山东、江苏、安徽、河南、湖北、云南、西藏等地匀有产出。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-fg9xv0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-fg9xv0y","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-gmy11yb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-gmy11yb","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 斜方晶系。晶形板状或短柱状，惟不多见，一般成致密粒状、大理石状集合体。颜色白灰、淡蓝、淡红及黑色等。条痕白色。玻璃或脂肪光泽。透明或微透明。断口参差状。硬度3-3.5。比重2.95。性脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-q1t0izn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-q1t0izn","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-mkpszwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-mkpszwl","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为扁块状或块状，有棱。江灰色、灰色或深灰色。条痕白色或浅灰色。体较重，质坚硬，指甲不易刻划成痕。但可砸碎，浅色者断面对光照之，具闪星样光泽，深色者光泽暗淡。无臭，无味。以色淡、有光泽者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-2pr3pra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-2pr3pra","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 透射偏光镜下：薄片无色透明；低正突起；呈三组相互正交的假立方体解理。干涉色较高，可达Ⅲ级绿色；平行消光；延长符号可正可负。二轴晶；正旋旋旋旋光性。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-wl9hcl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-wl9hcl8","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-08qx6le","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-08qx6le","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是天然产不含结晶水的石膏，主要成分是硫酸钙(CaSO4)。此外，常杂有微量的氧化铝(Al2O3)、二硫化铁(FeS2)、氧化镁(MgO)、二氧化硅(SiO2),以及锶、钡等。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-5oe07w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-5oe07w2","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-cke9rcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-cke9rcj","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品粉末1g，加稀盐酸10ml，加热，使溶解，滤过。滤液显钙盐和硫酸盐的各种反应。参见“石膏”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-5akqmy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-5akqmy0","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-rljy5u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-rljy5u6","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺；肝；膀胱；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-zctqd8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-zctqd8o","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-w7qbli6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-w7qbli6","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；辛；寒；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-e9fqs2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-e9fqs2z","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-9mxjd2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-9mxjd2d","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清肝明目；行气利水。主身热烦渴；目赤翳障；小便不利"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-eysu2zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-eysu2zj","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-17ee3jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-17ee3jy","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0．5～3两。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-46rfkbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-46rfkbx","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-9uwxvis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-9uwxvis","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主身热，四肢寒厥，利小便，通血脉，明目去翳眇。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-ueqzi2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-ueqzi2f","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：主胃中结气，止消渴，下气，除胁肋肺间邪气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-cc9z8pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-cc9z8pq","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611124846-yq3g1lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124846-yq3g1lj","updated":"20240611124846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124847-az09ndr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124847-az09ndr"}},{"ID":"20240611124958-c0hjuk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124958-c0hjuk7"}}]}